{"id": "07_median", "passed": true, "passed_first_try": true, "attempts_used": 1, "format_valid": true, "reason": "", "replies": ["```python\ndef median(values):\n    \"\"\"Return the median of a list of numbers.\"\"\"\n    if not values:\n        raise ValueError(\"List is empty\")\n    \n    sorted_values = sorted(values)\n    n = len(sorted_values)\n    mid = n // 2\n    \n    if n % 2 == 0:\n        return (sorted_values[mid - 1] + sorted_values[mid]) / 2\n    else:\n        return sorted_values[mid]\n```"], "timing": [{"ttft_s": 3.099, "ttfa_s": 65.242, "total_s": 68.441, "gen_tps": 38.016, "prompt_tps": 108.084, "prompt_tokens": 335, "completion_tokens": 2484, "tokens_estimated": false, "reasoning_chars": 7335, "finish_reason": "stop"}]}
{"id": "08_merge_intervals", "passed": true, "passed_first_try": true, "attempts_used": 1, "format_valid": true, "reason": "", "replies": ["```python\ndef merge_intervals(intervals):\n    \"\"\"Merge overlapping or touching (start, end) intervals.\"\"\"\n    # Sort a copy of the input to ensure the original list is not modified\n    # and to handle unsorted input.\n    sorted_intervals = sorted(intervals)\n    merged = []\n    for start, end in sorted_intervals:\n        # If merged is not empty and the current interval starts before or at \n        # the end of the last merged interval, they overlap or touch.\n        if merged and start <= merged[-1][1]:\n            # Update the end of the last merged interval to the maximum \n            # of its current end and the current interval's end.\n            # This handles both overlapping and nested intervals.\n            merged[-1] = (merged[-1][0], max(merged[-1][1], end))\n        else:\n            # Otherwise, add the current interval as a new entry in merged.\n            merged.append((start, end))\n    return merged\n```"], "timing": [{"ttft_s": 3.188, "ttfa_s": 99.536, "total_s": 106.041, "gen_tps": 36.82, "prompt_tps": 156.2, "prompt_tokens": 498, "completion_tokens": 3787, "tokens_estimated": false, "reasoning_chars": 10875, "finish_reason": "stop"}]}
